{
  "key": 21527,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0323_R02R0301_Route2_EastBuilding_Text_GiveHM05IfSeen10Mons",
      "en_US": [
        "Hi! Remember me?\n",
        "I’m one of Prof. Oak’s Aides.\r",
        "If your Pokédex has complete data\n",
        "on ten species, I’m supposed to\f",
        "give you a reward.\r",
        "Prof. Oak entrusted me with\n",
        "HM05 for you.\r",
        "So, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}, let me ask you.\r",
        "Have you gathered data on at least\n",
        "ten kinds of Pokémon?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0323_R02R0301_Route2_EastBuilding_Text_GreatHereYouGo",
      "en_US": [
        "Great! You have caught or owned\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0} kinds of Pokémon!\r",
        "Congratulations!\n",
        "Here you go!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0323_R02R0301_Route2_EastBuilding_Text_ReceivedHM05FromAide",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} received HM05\n",
        "from the Aide."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0323_R02R0301_Text_GymHack_AndTakeThisToo",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, and take this, too!\r",
        "It does the same job outside of\n",
        "battle, no Pokémon needed."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0323_R02R0301_Route2_EastBuilding_Text_ExplainHM05",
      "en_US": [
        "HM05 contains the hidden move\n",
        "Flash.\r",
        "Flash lights up even the darkest\n",
        "of caves and dungeons."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0323_R02R0301_Route2_EastBuilding_Text_CanGetThroughRockTunnel",
      "en_US": [
        "Once a Pokémon learns Flash, you\n",
        "can get through Rock Tunnel."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0323_R02R0301_PaintWorld_Text_FigureFirst",
      "en_US": [
        "… … …\r",
        "A figure made of paint turns to\n",
        "face you. It raises a brush."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0323_R02R0301_Aide_Text_GetEnoughMonsComeBackForItem",
      "en_US": [
        "…Oh. I see.\r",
        "When you get {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} kinds of Pokémon,\n",
        "come back for the {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0323_R02R0301_Aide_Text_HaventCaughtEnoughMonsForItem",
      "en_US": [
        "Let’s see…\n",
        "Uh-oh! You have caught only\f",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0} kinds of Pokémon!\r",
        "You need {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} kinds\n",
        "if you want the {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0323_R02R0301_Aide_Text_DontHaveAnyRoomForItem",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh! I see you don’t have any\n",
        "room for the {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0323_R02R0301_PaintWorld_Text_FigureSketch",
      "en_US": [
        "… … …\r",
        "The figure’s colors swirl.\n",
        "It’s waiting for you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0323_R02R0301_PaintWorld_Text_FigureMega",
      "en_US": [
        "… … …\r",
        "The figure is holding a stone that\n",
        "shines in every color."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0323_R02R0301_PaintWorld_Text_Dissolve",
      "en_US": [
        "The figure runs like wet paint…\n",
        "The world around it does too."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0323_R02R0301_cv_unported",
      "en_US": [
        "(Canvas DS: this part of the game\n",
        "isn’t ported yet.)"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
